<title>Colombia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/colombia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-colombia-2026-10-26T07:58:07.036Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 07:58:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;President De la Espriella confirmed the killing of two National Liberation Army leaders, while a strike in Cauca eliminated ten ELN fighters and a separate incident killed ten ELN rebels. A drone strike in Guapi wounded four soldiers and killed one Marine, and a car bomb at Casanare toll booths injured four women. A Colombian rapper stomped on an Israeli flag during a performance, and a quake in the country has killed over 250 people as rescuers search for survivors. Additionally, 14 miners died in a Nariño mine collapse and Santa Marta declared a red alert over flash floods, while 225 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQSjMzYm5rSFFhUlc3OTJIeGpjWENRakF6MEhjT0RCUGpaQ0otX0lyMV9TNWdnM0xpMUNXNEhaZlVjb0RXWXFqcGJycU9tN3ZXSHlzSkp5ODktZ3psNUtyN0lTWEhiVHlKd1lIQXpLaUdIOXRuS3NhZG90VTVubGxCdEtPV0pSVGh1U2t0b3I4Q25jWWtNOWZWOTI1Qk81ZENaM01n?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxPZlNzNUVOUHAyRWszSFZIUVd3cnhSalNPVGFIRUZhYUc1c1JldTRFYWRJSy05Z0ZEeEk0MjlxZ0o3Z3FVRTRtTnB5dzl5VE1NTXpUY2FVajRsRTJCOWpnZ052SXczN1E4c0JRZS1lcmZCR3hydXpJSEFqTjlqSkp0bTVqcXc1UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxOY3k4cHo0TV9FUUFleHZFQUVHTkZZUDZ5STZqbm1VMW1kdlRtcVI3bjlvcjVTWVlKblo4N1JlTlNuTXlBWjVNWUV3eHM3ejc3c2xERzFadnFFRFBLbnZvWUxXNy15TVkta25ONTVzaHp3N2hhTHdld2x3bFVtUWNiZjd3?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rozana Spokesman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxNSUJaOEtCSDNqZUhBcXJzdS1vUzhsTWxZWnhXazNrT0lScnBfamwyVmVyRm1vWExTRVkwd3dMNkNFR2xtSTcxTzFqWUdFMmZhR3oxZTUybE5XZGh5N0FqNXN2N2UxY3lHb0FOWEFfV0dQT2NZc05MWU1fR2hQQ2xZVF85VEJ2bGk4NUZ